      "before": "**Full SysON parity remains open.** The [remaining-work guide](REMAINING-WORK.md) states what remains, the next independent PRs, the dependency order and the evidence required to finish. The [797-entry task register](remaining-work/units.json) retains every adopted task and links to its detailed brief. These are review units, not a feature-completion percentage or a final PR count.",
